# window.sql:1872-2026: the built-in aggregates' moving-aggregate support.
# Each VALUES list in FROM is a table of its rows under the list's alias,
# replaced when the next list differs; v::int and v::bigint are written as
# CASTs, and v::numeric, over a list of numerics, as the column, numeric
# written DECIMAL(10,1) or DECIMAL(10,2) for the digits the list writes.
statement ok
